00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:58.860
de Keyboard

00:14:58.860 --> 00:14:59.600
durante el despliegue.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.780
Nunca los almacenan

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:01.660
en variables de pipeline

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:02.180
y en secretos

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:02.760
del repositorio.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:04.040
Si necesitas rotar

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:04.560
la contraseña

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:05.240
