00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:28.200
Esta es la postura

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:28.560
de seguridad

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:29.280
que realmente importa.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:30.380
La identidad

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.000
es el perímetro,

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:31.460
no la red.

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:32.760
No importa si alguien

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:33.360
está dentro

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:34.540
