00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:49.380
de configuración,

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:50.340
una variable de entorno

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.180
codificado en el código.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:52.280
Muévalo a KeyVault

00:17:52.280 --> 00:17:52.720
esta semana.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:53.200
Solo.

